  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Like the culinarily sophisticated monster that it is, your foe attempts to get at your delicious bone marrow by the most direct route possible. The long humerus bone of your upper arm splinters and cracks!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Strength</strong> Test to avoid also going @Condition[Prone]. You suffer a Broken Bone (Major).</p>"
    },
